#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:37
#: 74cbf98d87ca45bdadaa34f4b7a4e11b
msgid ""
"Per-joint `initial_value` on a `state_interface` is used when "
"`initialize_commands_from_state` is `false`. Joint `mimic` / `multiplier`"
" are standard ros2_control joint parameters read at the same `on_init`."
msgstr ""
"当 `initialize_commands_from_state` 为 `false` 时，使用各关节 `state_interface` 上的"
" `initial_value`。关节 `mimic` / `multiplier` 是同一 `on_init` 读取的标准 "
"ros2_control 关节参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:39
#: 41ae1fd0d94245ca998b58bc96f6bfb7
msgid ""
"Change any of these by editing the xacro (or the overlay that generates "
"it) and **restarting** the hardware. There is no `on_set_parameters` path"
" in this plugin."
msgstr "要改这些值，请编辑 xacro（或生成它的 overlay）并**重启**硬件。此插件没有 `on_set_parameters` 路径。"

